  - In release mode (optimized): throughput 1,218.6 blocks/sec (~11x speedup); total 5,000-block sync 4.10s.

  Testing 200 concurrent send reservations against active background sync (100 from separate thread + 100 from separate process)...
  Concurrency results across live background sync:
    Total concurrent reservations committed: 200 / 200 (100 thread + 100 child process)
